  ],
  "duration_s": 79.317914,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你酒量挺好的呀，领导您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯，鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹，是没有刺的这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密，小李，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方要向您请教。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导，一杯小李呀。我看你最近是越来越精神了啊，那是因为沾了领导，您的光，跟着您干事儿，气色都不敢差。哈哈哈小李，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您。哈哈哈，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 1470,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1650,
      "end_ms": 3130,
      "text": "领导您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3210,
      "end_ms": 4450,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4770,
      "end_ms": 6290,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6310,
      "end_ms": 6870,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7010,
      "end_ms": 8875,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11180,
      "end_ms": 12060,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12300,
      "end_ms": 13420,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13660,
      "end_ms": 13960,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13960,
      "end_ms": 15760,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16000,
      "end_ms": 17980,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17980,
      "end_ms": 21560,
      "text": "是没有刺的这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21760,
      "end_ms": 23240,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23440,
      "end_ms": 25100,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00015",
      "start_ms": 25180,
      "end_ms": 26520,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28140,
      "end_ms": 29580,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29740,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30920,
      "end_ms": 31320,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31320,
      "end_ms": 32280,
      "text": "才守得住秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00020",
      "start_ms": 34260,
      "end_ms": 34740,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00021",
      "start_ms": 35180,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00022",
      "start_ms": 36680,
      "end_ms": 37040,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00023",
      "start_ms": 37040,
      "end_ms": 38520,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00024",
      "start_ms": 38520,
      "end_ms": 39280,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00025",
      "start_ms": 39500,
      "end_ms": 41410,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方要向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00026",
      "start_ms": 44230,
      "end_ms": 44690,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00027",
      "start_ms": 44710,
      "end_ms": 45950,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00028",
      "start_ms": 46190,
      "end_ms": 48330,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00029",
      "start_ms": 48450,
      "end_ms": 49730,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00030",
      "start_ms": 50150,
      "end_ms": 50850,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00031",
      "start_ms": 50930,
      "end_ms": 52030,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00032",
      "start_ms": 52070,
      "end_ms": 53050,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00033",
      "start_ms": 53050,
      "end_ms": 55870,
      "text": "一杯小李呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00034",
      "start_ms": 56250,
      "end_ms": 58370,
      "text": "我看你最近是越来越精神了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00035",
      "start_ms": 58730,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "那是因为沾了领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00036",
      "start_ms": 60010,
      "end_ms": 60615,
      "text": "您的光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00037",
      "start_ms": 60930,
      "end_ms": 61850,
      "text": "跟着您干事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00038",
      "start_ms": 61870,
      "end_ms": 62885,
      "text": "气色都不敢差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00039",
      "start_ms": 63280,
      "end_ms": 64975,
      "text": "哈哈哈小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00040",
      "start_ms": 65410,
      "end_ms": 67105,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00041",
      "start_ms": 67360,
      "end_ms": 68990,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00042",
      "start_ms": 69170,
      "end_ms": 70690,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00043",
      "start_ms": 70690,
      "end_ms": 71690,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00044",
      "start_ms": 71730,
      "end_ms": 72555,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00045",
      "start_ms": 73000,
      "end_ms": 73555,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00046",
      "start_ms": 74300,
      "end_ms": 74905,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00047",
      "start_ms": 75210,
      "end_ms": 76490,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00048",
      "start_ms": 76490,
      "end_ms": 77325,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f31c8588d232002_s00049",
      "start_ms": 77580,
      "end_ms": 79105,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
